OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAA summer of queues and chaos for
OL,4,AUK-bound flights
OL,5,
OL,6,FWe may have thought the days of airport
OL,7,Fstress were winding down with the
OL,8,Fintroduction of e-passport scanning and
OL,9,Fno more liquid bags, but this was
OL,10,Fcertainly not the case for a lot of
OL,11,FLondoners and Brits alike this summer.
OL,13,FI was one of those on Tuesday. Despite
OL,14,Fgiving myself what I thought was a
OL,15,Fgenerous two-hour cushion before my
OL,16,Fflight to Stansted, I missed it. Or, as
OL,17,FI prefer to put it, it missed me.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
