OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1787383541
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAA summer of queues and chaos for
OL,4,AUK-bound flights
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere was a single passport control
OL,7,Fqueue that afternoon staffed by three
OL,8,Fofficers after a water leak closed
OL,9,Fanother set of booths. The queue was at
OL,10,Fleast 300 people strong when I joined
OL,11,Fit at 15:45 CET ahead of my Ryanair
OL,12,Fflight, scheduled for 17:55 local time.
OL,14,FFully operational since April, the EU
OL,15,Fhas introduced a system replacing
OL,16,Fmanual passport stamping for non-EU
OL,17,Fnationals, the Entry/Exit System (EES).
OL,18,FIt requires biometric registration of
OL,19,Ffingerprints, passport data and a
OL,20,Ffacial image on first entry.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
